Tala does not bundle any speech model. On first launch it downloads, from a
pinned revision, and verifies by SHA-256:

  Klang Pianissimo (KlangAI/pianissimo-sv) by Klang AI AB
  https://huggingface.co/KlangAI/pianissimo-sv
  License: CC BY 4.0 – https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Fine-tuned from NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 (CC BY 4.0)
  https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3

  Core ML conversion: markstrom/pianissimo-sv-coreml (CC BY 4.0), unchanged weights
  https://huggingface.co/markstrom/pianissimo-sv-coreml

Third-party software:

  FluidAudio by FluidInference – Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/FluidInference/FluidAudio

  The list of model files and their SHA-256 checksums is taken from
  Mindtalk by Mindact Solutions AB – MIT License
  https://github.com/dragon6sic6/Mindtalk

